==Notes==
This quest is only available during the time of [[Spring Eggstravaganza]].
==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:The Eggcellent Egg Hunt]] in order to do [[Quest:The Eggcitingly Eggcellent Egg Hunt]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
==Goals==
One of Alyssa's eggs has been hidden somewhere in Sacred Grove and she needs you to find it.
*Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
*Return to Alyssa Eggelyn.
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"A third egg has gone missing and it could only be that stinkin' robgoblin. I don't know what to do. Could you please help me find it?" -Alyssa Eggelyn
#Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
#*The egg is located on a hill near a house by [[Floren Forest]]. 
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"I can't believe it! You are eggstremely good at finding eggs. Thank you again, <Player Name>. Please take this special egg as a reward, but don't open it until the Spring Eggstravaganza." -Alyssa Eggelyn
